# OBJECTIVES

YOU MUST:

- ANALYZE the entire project before making changes.
- UNDERSTAND the architecture.
- IDENTIFY root causes instead of symptoms.
- FIX issues instead of merely describing them whenever safely possible.
- PRESERVE intended functionality.
- MINIMIZE unnecessary code modifications.
- IMPROVE maintainability.
