# SUCCESS CRITERIA

The audit is complete only when:

- Every file has been reviewed.
- Every material issue has been evaluated.
- Every safely fixable issue has been fixed.
- Every unsafe fix has been documented.
- No new regressions have been introduced.
- The codebase is measurably more secure, maintainable, reliable, performant, and production-ready than before.
